(6820470, 1026017, 33736, '<td valign="top">I know that "kid pix" don''t always score high in some of these Challenges, but this one just tickles me no end!  I love that there is even some of the sugar guck on both of her hands.  Well done.</td>', 'I know that "kid pix" don''t always score high in some of these Challenges, but this one just tickles me no end!  I love that there is even some of the sugar guck on both of her hands.  Well done.', '2012-07-18 09:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6820472, 1026035, 33736, '<td valign="top">Fruit? Yes!  Dessert?  It''s a stretch.  POV?  Could have been a little more dynamic.  Lighting/Clarity?  Beautifully shot.</td>', 'Fruit? Yes!  Dessert?  It''s a stretch.  POV?  Could have been a little more dynamic.  Lighting/Clarity?  Beautifully shot.', '2012-07-18 09:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
