(6821047, 1025765, 108982, '<td valign="top">Most HDRs turn me off.  This however is the type of thing that is honestly best served by HDR processing.  love the vintage appearance and depth of color.  I know how hard it is to pull this off without blowing out the well lit interior of the booth (been at fair all week and have tried to get this type or shot with minimal success) Possibly one of my favorite HDR-type ever.  9</td>', 'Most HDRs turn me off.  This however is the type of thing that is honestly best served by HDR processing.  love the vintage appearance and depth of color.  I know how hard it is to pull this off without blowing out the well lit interior of the booth (been at fair all week and have tried to get this type or shot with minimal success) Possibly one of my favorite HDR-type ever.  9', '2012-07-19 00:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
