(6822063, 1026073, 23394, '<td valign="top">This is a tough challenge to vote.  I''m torn between "what are <i>you</i> trying to do here" and "what do <i>I</i> expect here".  Further complicating matters is the question "what would I do here".<br/> <br/>What I would expect would be a technically strong piece of eye-candy that would present the dessert in a way that I would want to at least sample it, if not order it.  Along these lines I''m looking at technicals:  backgrounds, distracting elements, exposure, sharpness.  I''m also looking for creativity, imagination, and originality, which can make up for less than perfect technicals.<br/> <br/>So, where does this leave me with your image?<br/> <br/>While this is one of my top ten for the challenge, I think it could use a little work.  It''s a little too contrasty, leaving me feeling a sense of imbalance between the darker and lighter sides.  I am fine with the DoF, but the lack of detail caused by the over-exposure on the left takes away from my overall impression.  Maybe a little less light on the left and some slight fill on the right would have balanced it out.</td>', 'This is a tough challenge to vote.  I''m torn between "what are you trying to do here" and "what do I expect here".  Further complicating matters is the question "what would I do here". What I would expect would be a technically strong piece of eye-candy that would present the dessert in a way that I would want to at least sample it, if not order it.  Along these lines I''m looking at technicals:  backgrounds, distracting elements, exposure, sharpness.  I''m also looking for creativity, imagination, and originality, which can make up for less than perfect technicals. So, where does this leave me with your image? While this is one of my top ten for the challenge, I think it could use a little work.  It''s a little too contrasty, leaving me feeling a sense of imbalance between the darker and lighter sides.  I am fine with the DoF, but the lack of detail caused by the over-exposure on the left takes away from my overall impression.  Maybe a little less light on the left and some slight fill on the right would have balanced it out.', '2012-07-20 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822064, 1025976, 23394, '<td valign="top">This is a tough challenge to vote.  I''m torn between "what are <i>you</i> trying to do here" and "what do <i>I</i> expect here".  Further complicating matters is the question "what would I do here".<br/> <br/>What I would expect would be a technically strong piece of eye-candy that would present the dessert in a way that I would want to at least sample it, if not order it.  Along these lines I''m looking at technicals:  backgrounds, distracting elements, exposure, sharpness.  I''m also looking for creativity, imagination, and originality, which can make up for less than perfect technicals.<br/> <br/>So, where does this leave me with your image?<br/> <br/>I love the idea and composition, but feel that your exposure got away from you.  I can tell you what I would do, but can''t begin to tell how dpc is going to react...</td>', 'This is a tough challenge to vote.  I''m torn between "what are you trying to do here" and "what do I expect here".  Further complicating matters is the question "what would I do here". What I would expect would be a technically strong piece of eye-candy that would present the dessert in a way that I would want to at least sample it, if not order it.  Along these lines I''m looking at technicals:  backgrounds, distracting elements, exposure, sharpness.  I''m also looking for creativity, imagination, and originality, which can make up for less than perfect technicals. So, where does this leave me with your image? I love the idea and composition, but feel that your exposure got away from you.  I can tell you what I would do, but can''t begin to tell how dpc is going to react...', '2012-07-20 07:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822071, 1026021, 23394, '<td valign="top">This is a tough challenge to vote.  I''m torn between "what are <i>you</i> trying to do here" and "what do <i>I</i> expect here".  Further complicating matters is the question "what would I do here".<br/> <br/>What I would expect would be a technically strong piece of eye-candy that would present the dessert in a way that I would want to at least sample it, if not order it.  Along these lines I''m looking at technicals:  backgrounds, distracting elements, exposure, sharpness.  I''m also looking for creativity, imagination, and originality, which can make up for less than perfect technicals.<br/> <br/>So, where does this leave me with your image?<br/> <br/>This is beautiful; expertly envisioned and executed, this should do very well in the challenge.  The exposure is simply perfect.  If you''d put ten similar shots into a portfolio, you could probably pick up some nice (paying) work from just about any pastry shop that wants to be competitive.</td>', 'This is a tough challenge to vote.  I''m torn between "what are you trying to do here" and "what do I expect here".  Further complicating matters is the question "what would I do here". What I would expect would be a technically strong piece of eye-candy that would present the dessert in a way that I would want to at least sample it, if not order it.  Along these lines I''m looking at technicals:  backgrounds, distracting elements, exposure, sharpness.  I''m also looking for creativity, imagination, and originality, which can make up for less than perfect technicals. So, where does this leave me with your image? This is beautiful; expertly envisioned and executed, this should do very well in the challenge.  The exposure is simply perfect.  If you''d put ten similar shots into a portfolio, you could probably pick up some nice (paying) work from just about any pastry shop that wants to be competitive.', '2012-07-20 07:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
