(6822197, 1026077, 143098, '<td valign="top">a truly awesome cake for sure...someone spent some time on this I know my wife likes to do these kinds of cakes, just not as big as this one.  Overall nice colors, only thing I would suggest is possibly moving cake about 1''-2'' from wall and get a little more bokeh if possible, unfortunately the top 1/3 of the cake to me gets lost in the brickwork somewhat, or shoot against a solid background if possible. Other than that nice shot of a cool cake.</td>', 'a truly awesome cake for sure...someone spent some time on this I know my wife likes to do these kinds of cakes, just not as big as this one.  Overall nice colors, only thing I would suggest is possibly moving cake about 1''-2'' from wall and get a little more bokeh if possible, unfortunately the top 1/3 of the cake to me gets lost in the brickwork somewhat, or shoot against a solid background if possible. Other than that nice shot of a cool cake.', '2012-07-20 09:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822199, 1025939, 77185, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this, it screams afternoon tea (coffee), maybe with a window open to let in a Summer breeze, listen to the birds, enjoy a quiet moment... and those raspberries look so nice and fresh, if I could reach down and snag one I would!</td>', 'I love the lighting in this, it screams afternoon tea (coffee), maybe with a window open to let in a Summer breeze, listen to the birds, enjoy a quiet moment... and those raspberries look so nice and fresh, if I could reach down and snag one I would!', '2012-07-20 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822202, 1026070, 143098, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times, I can''t decide if I like it or not.  obviously the goal was an oof somewhat abstract.  I fear that many will not rate this high as it is not a clear cut dessert...That being said the original challenge stated "photograph something <u>sweet</u> and delicious" so in a way this dmc.  I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times, I can''t decide if I like it or not.  obviously the goal was an oof somewhat abstract.  I fear that many will not rate this high as it is not a clear cut dessert...That being said the original challenge stated "photograph something sweet and delicious" so in a way this dmc.  I hope it does well for you.', '2012-07-20 09:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822203, 1026031, 77185, '<td valign="top">An interesting dessert. Looks tasty. I wish it wasn''t cut off top and bottom, but maybe something caused that to be necessary?</td>', 'An interesting dessert. Looks tasty. I wish it wasn''t cut off top and bottom, but maybe something caused that to be necessary?', '2012-07-20 09:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
