(6822206, 1025940, 143098, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a different looking desert for sure.  nice texture on the berry up front.  the composition is ok but think i would like to see a different angle as well before deciding if i wanted to try this dessert.</td>', 'This is definitely a different looking desert for sure.  nice texture on the berry up front.  the composition is ok but think i would like to see a different angle as well before deciding if i wanted to try this dessert.', '2012-07-20 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822213, 1026035, 143098, '<td valign="top">Cantaloupe? wouldn''t immediately pick this as a dessert in the traditional sense. That being said it is sweet so it dmc. That aside, I''m really loving the textures here.  The lighting is nice and the muted tones are very pleasing to the eye.  This shot would definitely look good blown up hanging on a wall imo. (bumping to an 8)</td>', 'Cantaloupe? wouldn''t immediately pick this as a dessert in the traditional sense. That being said it is sweet so it dmc. That aside, I''m really loving the textures here.  The lighting is nice and the muted tones are very pleasing to the eye.  This shot would definitely look good blown up hanging on a wall imo. (bumping to an 8)', '2012-07-20 09:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822223, 1025824, 77185, '<td valign="top">Do they last that long? I''d eat it in ten! I like the idea, almost looks like it''s glowing. Nitpick: not so fond of the harsh light on the stem side. I do love the network pattern from the leaf wrap thinger (that''s totally a botanical term!).<br/> <br/>... why did I suddenly start thinking about aliens? Better move on...</td>', 'Do they last that long? I''d eat it in ten! I like the idea, almost looks like it''s glowing. Nitpick: not so fond of the harsh light on the stem side. I do love the network pattern from the leaf wrap thinger (that''s totally a botanical term!). ... why did I suddenly start thinking about aliens? Better move on...', '2012-07-20 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822224, 1025956, 143098, '<td valign="top">fun shot, should, would have been neat if you had taken a sharpie and made the ball look like a soccer ball.  (imo).  nice fun take on the theme.</td>', 'fun shot, should, would have been neat if you had taken a sharpie and made the ball look like a soccer ball.  (imo).  nice fun take on the theme.', '2012-07-20 09:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822230, 1026067, 143098, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot the pastel colors compliment each other nicely. It is a little bright in some areas though, and that may have been what you were going for, but where the flower overlaps the plate I think a more definite edge might help a little.</td>', 'This is a nice shot the pastel colors compliment each other nicely. It is a little bright in some areas though, and that may have been what you were going for, but where the flower overlaps the plate I think a more definite edge might help a little.', '2012-07-20 09:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822234, 1026027, 143098, '<td valign="top">these look yummy. the composition doesn''t work for me 100% think I would one of the front tarts staggered back a little the balance seems a little odd to me, that being said there is nothing wrong with this the way it is. nice food shot.</td>', 'these look yummy. the composition doesn''t work for me 100% think I would one of the front tarts staggered back a little the balance seems a little odd to me, that being said there is nothing wrong with this the way it is. nice food shot.', '2012-07-20 09:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822238, 1025730, 77185, '<td valign="top">Why don''t I get notes like these? *sighs* I''d be sweet then!<br/> <br/>Anyhow, this is a great photo. Maybe it''s my laptop monitor, but the strawberries look a bit dark. The whole things looks very, very delicious, but the ribbon pulls the attention from the actual dessert some. That could be intentional, I guess, a nice letter can be sweet as well... hmmm. Maybe the REAL dessert is in the letter? <br/> <br/>I might be overthinking this.</td>', 'Why don''t I get notes like these? *sighs* I''d be sweet then! Anyhow, this is a great photo. Maybe it''s my laptop monitor, but the strawberries look a bit dark. The whole things looks very, very delicious, but the ribbon pulls the attention from the actual dessert some. That could be intentional, I guess, a nice letter can be sweet as well... hmmm. Maybe the REAL dessert is in the letter?  I might be overthinking this.', '2012-07-20 09:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822240, 1025941, 143098, '<td valign="top">nice, well executed shot here, really having nothing to critique, like the use of the mint leaves to bring in some contrasting color.</td>', 'nice, well executed shot here, really having nothing to critique, like the use of the mint leaves to bring in some contrasting color.', '2012-07-20 09:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822242, 1025548, 143098, '<td valign="top">nice shot, background and wood floor gives this a farmhouse kind of feel to it.  makes me think of something you''d enjoy after a long day at the farm.</td>', 'nice shot, background and wood floor gives this a farmhouse kind of feel to it.  makes me think of something you''d enjoy after a long day at the farm.', '2012-07-20 09:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822244, 1025570, 77185, '<td valign="top">But I''d die HAPPY!</td>', 'But I''d die HAPPY!', '2012-07-20 09:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822247, 1025570, 143098, '<td valign="top">death by chocolate indeed. nice enough shot good setup and lines created by layers help draw you all the way around the shot.</td>', 'death by chocolate indeed. nice enough shot good setup and lines created by layers help draw you all the way around the shot.', '2012-07-20 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822249, 1026061, 143098, '<td valign="top">nice shot overall, did a good job making the cake look apetizing.</td>', 'nice shot overall, did a good job making the cake look apetizing.', '2012-07-20 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822265, 1025940, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Colorful, sweet and delicious - I really enjoy the close-up view you give us of this dessert. The red of the rasberry really pops vibrantly and draws the eye in instantly. You have captured great details on the red berry and the chocolate ''cups'' that hold the cream and fruit. The foreground in the front is nicely focused for details and then the eye travels back to see all the sweet treats in the background horizon - making it appear that the promise of sweet delights is vast and unending:-) My only critique is that it may increase the visual appeal a bit more if just a little more of the fruits were in sharp focus before it falls off into bokeh. Not too much though; just from the rasberry and the two blueberries behind it.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Colorful, sweet and delicious - I really enjoy the close-up view you give us of this dessert. The red of the rasberry really pops vibrantly and draws the eye in instantly. You have captured great details on the red berry and the chocolate ''cups'' that hold the cream and fruit. The foreground in the front is nicely focused for details and then the eye travels back to see all the sweet treats in the background horizon - making it appear that the promise of sweet delights is vast and unending:-) My only critique is that it may increase the visual appeal a bit more if just a little more of the fruits were in sharp focus before it falls off into bokeh. Not too much though; just from the rasberry and the two blueberries behind it.', '2012-07-20 10:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822549, 1026024, 149779, '<td valign="top">I like the crispness and reflections in the chocolate but think a less busy background would have helped keep the focus on the sweetness.</td>', 'I like the crispness and reflections in the chocolate but think a less busy background would have helped keep the focus on the sweetness.', '2012-07-20 12:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822550, 1026070, 149779, '<td valign="top">great color.  I like it.</td>', 'great color.  I like it.', '2012-07-20 12:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822551, 1025940, 149779, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop, good focal distance, and good color.</td>', 'Interesting crop, good focal distance, and good color.', '2012-07-20 12:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822554, 1026080, 149779, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but think the color balance could go a little less green.  It is very challenging to remove color cast when there is so much green reflective light, but maybe introducing some more red somewhere in the image might have made it easier to balance.</td>', 'I like the concept, but think the color balance could go a little less green.  It is very challenging to remove color cast when there is so much green reflective light, but maybe introducing some more red somewhere in the image might have made it easier to balance.', '2012-07-20 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822556, 1026053, 149779, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh, good focal point.  I think with more aggressive cropping it could have been a lot more powerful.  About 75% of the image is really not necessary to say what you are intending.</td>', 'Nice bokeh, good focal point.  I think with more aggressive cropping it could have been a lot more powerful.  About 75% of the image is really not necessary to say what you are intending.', '2012-07-20 12:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822557, 1026061, 149779, '<td valign="top">This might be my favorite.  I love the cropping, the focus, and the balance.  I *might* like to see more color, but then again, it seems to be holding its own just fine.</td>', 'This might be my favorite.  I love the cropping, the focus, and the balance.  I *might* like to see more color, but then again, it seems to be holding its own just fine.', '2012-07-20 12:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822558, 1025606, 149779, '<td valign="top">Great attention to detail.  I would have preferred to see a tighter crop without the extra space under the plate especially.</td>', 'Great attention to detail.  I would have preferred to see a tighter crop without the extra space under the plate especially.', '2012-07-20 12:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822559, 1025925, 149779, '<td valign="top">I really like the bold crop and the soft focus.  Great job.  I might like to see more green just to balance out the browns and reds.</td>', 'I really like the bold crop and the soft focus.  Great job.  I might like to see more green just to balance out the browns and reds.', '2012-07-20 12:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822563, 1026071, 149779, '<td valign="top">This image has great focal distance and a great focal point.  I wish it was a lot closer cropped though since it feels very top-heavy.</td>', 'This image has great focal distance and a great focal point.  I wish it was a lot closer cropped though since it feels very top-heavy.', '2012-07-20 12:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822570, 1025822, 149779, '<td valign="top">As far as portrait photography goes, this little guy has one very bright nose, while the rest of his face is mostly in shadow.  It isn''t the most flattering of lighting choices, but it makes it look more like a snapshot taken by chance than an intentionally shot photograph.  His cookie is somewhat insignificant in this cropping.  If it was cropped down to the cookie, the hands, and the lips, the lighting may seem much more appropriate with the focus going primarily on the cookie and hands.</td>', 'As far as portrait photography goes, this little guy has one very bright nose, while the rest of his face is mostly in shadow.  It isn''t the most flattering of lighting choices, but it makes it look more like a snapshot taken by chance than an intentionally shot photograph.  His cookie is somewhat insignificant in this cropping.  If it was cropped down to the cookie, the hands, and the lips, the lighting may seem much more appropriate with the focus going primarily on the cookie and hands.', '2012-07-20 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822575, 1026067, 149779, '<td valign="top">Love the color.  I would prefer to see the focal point not set dead center, and maybe an angle that included the same elements without having them so spread out around the frame.</td>', 'Love the color.  I would prefer to see the focal point not set dead center, and maybe an angle that included the same elements without having them so spread out around the frame.', '2012-07-20 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822578, 1025976, 149779, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the angle and the cropping.  I am not a big fan of the solid frame around images, so this is distracting for me, but hardly important as far as photography goes.</td>', 'I LOVE the angle and the cropping.  I am not a big fan of the solid frame around images, so this is distracting for me, but hardly important as far as photography goes.', '2012-07-20 13:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822582, 1025993, 149779, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites because I LOVE action, especially in product photography.  I really would have preferred if the subject was not dead center and at such a straight-on angle, since it moves all the action in the image out away from the frame.  I find my eyes constantly just want to leave this picture and follow the splashes off the photo.</td>', 'One of my favorites because I LOVE action, especially in product photography.  I really would have preferred if the subject was not dead center and at such a straight-on angle, since it moves all the action in the image out away from the frame.  I find my eyes constantly just want to leave this picture and follow the splashes off the photo.', '2012-07-20 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822583, 1026021, 149779, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the balance.  I wish the yellows were a little brighter though.</td>', 'I love the colors and the balance.  I wish the yellows were a little brighter though.', '2012-07-20 13:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822591, 1026068, 149779, '<td valign="top">I like the concept on this one so much!  I wish it was more dramatically angled and cropped much more tightly though.  There is a lot of space that just isn''t really necessary and is distracting to the great elements in the concept.  Good use of color for emphasis too.</td>', 'I like the concept on this one so much!  I wish it was more dramatically angled and cropped much more tightly though.  There is a lot of space that just isn''t really necessary and is distracting to the great elements in the concept.  Good use of color for emphasis too.', '2012-07-20 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822595, 1026031, 149779, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the very best composed images in this challenge.  It has great textures, good colors, interesting shapes, and is well balanced and cropped.  The color balance seems a little on the red side.  I think this image would have benefitted a lot from a single light source or a more interesting light source rather than what appears to be several overhead fluorescent rectangle lights.</td>', 'I think this is one of the very best composed images in this challenge.  It has great textures, good colors, interesting shapes, and is well balanced and cropped.  The color balance seems a little on the red side.  I think this image would have benefitted a lot from a single light source or a more interesting light source rather than what appears to be several overhead fluorescent rectangle lights.', '2012-07-20 13:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822596, 1025957, 149779, '<td valign="top">I love the angle, focal distance, and lighting.  I think the lunch box(?) in the background is a little distracting, and the whole image would have benefitted from a lighter table top and/r background.</td>', 'I love the angle, focal distance, and lighting.  I think the lunch box(?) in the background is a little distracting, and the whole image would have benefitted from a lighter table top and/r background.', '2012-07-20 13:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822631, 1025548, 149779, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, focus, and color on the dessert.  I think a more daring angle would have added a lot, and a solid background and tabletop would have made this one really pop.</td>', 'Great lighting, focus, and color on the dessert.  I think a more daring angle would have added a lot, and a solid background and tabletop would have made this one really pop.', '2012-07-20 13:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822639, 1025594, 149779, '<td valign="top">I like the blue and yellow contrast.  The color balance makes the chocolate a little too yellow to be appetizing though.  I like the close crop and the composition, but think it could have been even closer for more interest.  I also wish the focal distance was far enough to blur out the scratches on the plate.</td>', 'I like the blue and yellow contrast.  The color balance makes the chocolate a little too yellow to be appetizing though.  I like the close crop and the composition, but think it could have been even closer for more interest.  I also wish the focal distance was far enough to blur out the scratches on the plate.', '2012-07-20 13:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822641, 1026077, 149779, '<td valign="top">The cake is very cool, but the photograph could do a lot more to capture its awesomeness.  There are great colors to work with, the overall balance is great, but the image is not nearly as interesting as the cake itself.  THe background is far too busy and doesn''t add to the image.  The angle is very static and stable, not fun or whimsical like the cake is trying to convey.  The cake itself if very well designed and executed, so the photograph would do much better using the same design concepts.</td>', 'The cake is very cool, but the photograph could do a lot more to capture its awesomeness.  There are great colors to work with, the overall balance is great, but the image is not nearly as interesting as the cake itself.  THe background is far too busy and doesn''t add to the image.  The angle is very static and stable, not fun or whimsical like the cake is trying to convey.  The cake itself if very well designed and executed, so the photograph would do much better using the same design concepts.', '2012-07-20 14:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822656, 1026073, 149507, '<td valign="top">I like the balance of colors against the white cream. The narrow DOF helps accentuate the softness of the cream. I think you could have been a little bolder with your angles and your crop. Also, the strawberry is a little smashed on the side facing the camera.</td>', 'I like the balance of colors against the white cream. The narrow DOF helps accentuate the softness of the cream. I think you could have been a little bolder with your angles and your crop. Also, the strawberry is a little smashed on the side facing the camera.', '2012-07-20 14:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822676, 1026024, 149507, '<td valign="top">All the colors in the background are a distraction from your main subject and compete to be the focal point.</td>', 'All the colors in the background are a distraction from your main subject and compete to be the focal point.', '2012-07-20 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822687, 1026017, 149507, '<td valign="top">Good pose, focus and choice of focal depth. The background could be darker or differently-colored to give more depth. It could be more intriguing with a tighter crop.</td>', 'Good pose, focus and choice of focal depth. The background could be darker or differently-colored to give more depth. It could be more intriguing with a tighter crop.', '2012-07-20 15:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822702, 1025684, 143116, '<td valign="top">Very well lit, I like the composition. Great shot, well lit. You very nicely define the glass plate, but it gets lost on the back left.</td>', 'Very well lit, I like the composition. Great shot, well lit. You very nicely define the glass plate, but it gets lost on the back left.', '2012-07-20 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822704, 1025594, 143116, '<td valign="top">The yelow-on-blue made the difference for me. Like the composition too.</td>', 'The yelow-on-blue made the difference for me. Like the composition too.', '2012-07-20 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822711, 1026017, 143116, '<td valign="top">Well captured.<br/> <br/>PS she should''ve washed her hands ....</td>', 'Well captured. PS she should''ve washed her hands ....', '2012-07-20 15:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
