(6822777, 1025976, 143116, '<td valign="top">Looks very tasty. As an image I would''ve moved the frame a little higher, now the lady fingers are a little overpowering. The area on the right looks a bit messy, maybe clean that up next time.</td>', 'Looks very tasty. As an image I would''ve moved the frame a little higher, now the lady fingers are a little overpowering. The area on the right looks a bit messy, maybe clean that up next time.', '2012-07-20 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822783, 1026041, 143116, '<td valign="top">I love strawberries, but these are a little too dark to my taste.</td>', 'I love strawberries, but these are a little too dark to my taste.', '2012-07-20 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822786, 1025993, 143116, '<td valign="top">Flying cream!</td>', 'Flying cream!', '2012-07-20 16:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822791, 1025824, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, too bad the backlight has blown through the fruit.</td>', 'I like the concept, too bad the backlight has blown through the fruit.', '2012-07-20 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822820, 1025548, 143116, '<td valign="top">In this shot your dessert has a hard time competing for attention with such overpowering background and table. I like the lighting on the cream.</td>', 'In this shot your dessert has a hard time competing for attention with such overpowering background and table. I like the lighting on the cream.', '2012-07-20 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822821, 1026071, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the strawberry does not look very attractive which puts me off. Apparently it''s not only about photography this challenge ....</td>', 'I like the composition, but the strawberry does not look very attractive which puts me off. Apparently it''s not only about photography this challenge ....', '2012-07-20 16:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822828, 1026080, 143116, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the echo of the green background in the lettering, but the chocolate mints could use a little more light, I think.</td>', 'I appreciate the echo of the green background in the lettering, but the chocolate mints could use a little more light, I think.', '2012-07-20 16:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822831, 1026024, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like the shine on the chocolate, but the background is distracting and dominates the shot.</td>', 'I like the shine on the chocolate, but the background is distracting and dominates the shot.', '2012-07-20 16:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822832, 1026053, 143116, '<td valign="top">Looks very tasty, but also a little too small DOF</td>', 'Looks very tasty, but also a little too small DOF', '2012-07-20 16:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822834, 1026068, 143116, '<td valign="top">I tried to spot the focal plane but coud not find it, except for the few square inches on the wall behind the arrow.</td>', 'I tried to spot the focal plane but coud not find it, except for the few square inches on the wall behind the arrow.', '2012-07-20 16:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822835, 1025994, 143116, '<td valign="top">Your focus is well placed, but I would have moved her to the right in the frame to give her room to look into. Then it would probably be more obvious  the distracting bottom left corner would need to be straightened out.</td>', 'Your focus is well placed, but I would have moved her to the right in the frame to give her room to look into. Then it would probably be more obvious  the distracting bottom left corner would need to be straightened out.', '2012-07-20 16:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822837, 1026067, 143116, '<td valign="top">I think the high viewpoint is not very effective. The focus is well placed, but the tulips are now OOF.</td>', 'I think the high viewpoint is not very effective. The focus is well placed, but the tulips are now OOF.', '2012-07-20 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822839, 1026059, 143116, '<td valign="top">The cream bowl on the left competes with your dessert, which is now no longer separated from the background. Unfortunate that the spoon cuts through the strawberry.</td>', 'The cream bowl on the left competes with your dessert, which is now no longer separated from the background. Unfortunate that the spoon cuts through the strawberry.', '2012-07-20 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822844, 1025982, 143116, '<td valign="top">Not my most favorite image, sorry. I would have moved her to the right of the frame to give her some room to look into. The motion blur and more so the guy in the background distract from your subject.</td>', 'Not my most favorite image, sorry. I would have moved her to the right of the frame to give her some room to look into. The motion blur and more so the guy in the background distract from your subject.', '2012-07-20 16:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822847, 1026076, 143116, '<td valign="top">Compared to the other shots in this challenge this does not convey "desserts" very effectively, I think. Could also be a tad sharper on the eyes.</td>', 'Compared to the other shots in this challenge this does not convey "desserts" very effectively, I think. Could also be a tad sharper on the eyes.', '2012-07-20 16:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822848, 1026075, 143116, '<td valign="top">DOF  is very shallow, and you could use a little more light in the front</td>', 'DOF  is very shallow, and you could use a little more light in the front', '2012-07-20 16:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822852, 1025635, 149507, '<td valign="top">I can''t see that this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t see that this meets the challenge.', '2012-07-20 16:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822864, 1026049, 143116, '<td valign="top">Please brace yourself, and take this as intended: as pointers to help improve your photography. ... Next time, watch your focus (this is in front of the standing cookie, should be on the cookies face), Use a smaller diaphragm setting to increase DOF and watch your lighting (e.g place a reflector such as a piece of white foamboard to the right to fill the hard shadows).</td>', 'Please brace yourself, and take this as intended: as pointers to help improve your photography. ... Next time, watch your focus (this is in front of the standing cookie, should be on the cookies face), Use a smaller diaphragm setting to increase DOF and watch your lighting (e.g place a reflector such as a piece of white foamboard to the right to fill the hard shadows).', '2012-07-20 17:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6822944, 1026061, 143116, '<td valign="top">Very well done, 9. Missed perfection by just a little detail: the fork ''s end is just a tad too much out of focus</td>', 'Very well done, 9. Missed perfection by just a little detail: the fork ''s end is just a tad too much out of focus', '2012-07-20 18:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
