(6825356, 1026061, 137576, '<td valign="top">my top pick for the challenge with a 9, i think its wendy''s judging by the fork and the style, id like just a little more contrast between the plate and the background and the top white layer and the yellower sponge above it. nice composition although the fork steals a lot of the cakes thunder....</td>', 'my top pick for the challenge with a 9, i think its wendy''s judging by the fork and the style, id like just a little more contrast between the plate and the background and the top white layer and the yellower sponge above it. nice composition although the fork steals a lot of the cakes thunder....', '2012-07-23 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825357, 1025606, 137576, '<td valign="top">i gave this an 8 and i like the stylishness of it, i feel its a little dark though on the pudding that facing us, needed some fill light to compliment the bright spoon reflection. i like the drip on the nose of the monster.</td>', 'i gave this an 8 and i like the stylishness of it, i feel its a little dark though on the pudding that facing us, needed some fill light to compliment the bright spoon reflection. i like the drip on the nose of the monster.', '2012-07-23 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
