(6826558, 1025994, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and idea.  The table corner in the bottom left is a bit distracting and it seems she should have more space on the left.  Still lovely.</td>', 'Nice lighting and idea.  The table corner in the bottom left is a bit distracting and it seems she should have more space on the left.  Still lovely.', '2012-07-24 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
